## chart lifecycle OSS Skills Invocation Lifecycle
```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
  participant A as Agent
  participant H as Harness
  participant S as SKILL.md
  participant R as scripts refs assets
  participant O as Skillbox overlay
  A->>H: trigger matches skill description
  H->>S: load SKILL.md workflow
  S->>O: resolve private context if overlay present
  S->>R: run deterministic helper scripts
  R-->>A: structured output and artifacts
  A->>S: follow validation and closeout steps
  Note over S,R: GREEN path proven by 587 collected tests
```

